      "text": [
        "1728 - قَالَ رَسُولُ اَللَّهِ صَلَّى اَللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَ آلِهِ : «أَرْضُ اَلْقِيَامَةِ نَارٌ مَا خَلاَ ظِلَّ اَلْمُؤْمِنِ فَإِنَّ صَدَقَتَهُ تُظِلُّهُ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.1728 - The Messenger of Allah (swt), peace and blessings be upon him and his family, said:\n\"The ground of the Day of Resurrection will be fire, except for the shade provided for the believer, for his charity will shield him.\""
        ]
      }
